  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\nWe have,\n\n(2x+7y)/(4x-3y)=(8)/(3)\n\n⇒ 3(2x + 7y) = 8(4x - 3y)\n\n⇒ 6x + 21y = 32x - 24y\n\n⇒ 21y + 24y = 32x - 6x\n\n⇒ 45y = 26x\n\n⇒ 26x = 45y\n\n⇒ x/y = 45/26\n\n**Hence, x : y is 45 : 26.**",
